/* sql s06 v2 (2026-10-30): Lesson S06 labs, classes sq06- (labs-sql-s06.js). v2: two-phase ON vs WHERE, NOT IN three ways, org tree, grain meter, algorithms run step by step + scale/spill simulation; light Venn contrast; result grids no longer cut off */
.sq06 .an-foot:empty{display:none}
