   restart race .dx2-lane/.dx2-track (.dx2-run/.dx2-wait/.dx2-off, markers .dx2-mk, sweep .dx2-veil), signals .dx2-sig/.dx2-col/.dx2-clock,
   resources .dx2-gauge */
.dx2-pad{padding:14px 18px}
