/* sysdesign H24 v1: key-value store + web crawler labs (assets/labs/sysdesign/labs-sd-24.js, 2026-11-06): controls .sd24-gc/.sd24-tg, KPI
   tiles .sd24-kp, verdicts .sd24-out, tables .sd24-mx, hash ring .sd24-ring + node colours .sd24-n0…n7, load bars .sd24-bars, quorum nodes
   .sd24-qn/.sd24-node, Merkle tree .sd24-mk, gossip dots .sd24-dots/.sd24-meter, frontier lanes .sd24-lanes + host colours .sd24-h0…h3,
   Bloom bits .sd24-bits, robots.txt .sd24-rb. Placed at the end of the file (built out of order while H14–H23 are in progress elsewhere). */
.sd24-gc{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 16px;align-items:center;padding:12px 18px 4px}
.sd24-tg{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;align-items:center;min-width:0}.sd24-tg>span{font:600 .74rem Inter,sans-serif;color:var(--muted);margin-right:2px}
