   HATEOAS state machine .ax1-sm + link buttons .ax1-lk, layer hops .ax1-hops, code on demand .ax1-code, maturity columns .ax1-rmm/.ax1-lv */
.ax1-pad{padding:12px 14px 14px;min-width:0}
