}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.dbk-tk,.dbk-pct em,.dbk-lb em,.dbk-dot,.dbk-po,details.dbk-con>summary::before{transition:none}.dbk-enter,.dbk-in-anim,.dbk-win,.dbk-tk.dbk-pop{animation:none}}
html.no-motion .dbk-tk,html.no-motion .dbk-pct em,html.no-motion .dbk-lb em,html.no-motion .dbk-dot,html.no-motion .dbk-po{transition:none}
html.no-motion .dbk-enter,html.no-motion .dbk-in-anim,html.no-motion .dbk-win,html.no-motion .dbk-tk.dbk-pop{animation:none}

/* spring playground v1 (2026-11-07): courses/spring/playground.html, assets/labs/spring/labs-spring-play.js, classes spg-*. Missions .spg-mis / .spg-mc /
   banner .spg-mb; #spgPlay = tabs .spg-tab, bar, action palette .spg-pal / .spg-pi, then .spg-body = editor .spg-ed | live view .spg-view (two
   columns from 980 px). Container: class cards .spg-cl (code .spg-code, toggles .spg-tg, deps .spg-deps), bean graph .spg-bn (made / cre / pend /
   cyc), lifecycle .spg-lf, getBean .spg-g. Request: pipeline chips .spg-pp (spg-k-pass / act / stop / skip / idle, lit in order with .spg-lit and
   a transition-delay), status .spg-code2. Data: counter .spg-big, owners .spg-own (spg-o-ok / no / err / dto), lanes .spg-lane. Mesh: the kit's
   SB.mesh panel inside .spg-mesh. Console .spg-con (dark, like the kit's). */
.spg-head{padding-bottom:6px}
.spg-sec{margin:0 0 22px}
.spg-mis{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;background:var(--surface);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:14px}
.spg-mh{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px 16px;margin-bottom:12px}
